/E (NYCA is a youth-led coalition of Nepalese youth and youth groups established on 10 August 2008, with the motto "Caring for Climate, Caring for Ourselves". NYCA works to protect Nepal and its people from the adverse impacts of climate change through awareness, policy advocacy and a nationwide youth movement. It collaborates with universities, schools, organisations and communities at local, national and international levels, has active chapters across all seven provinces, and its secretariat is hosted by Clean Energy Nepal.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [7]
