/P 198 0 R
/T (LCOY Nepal 2026 followed a three-phase design, that includes:)
/E (LCOY Nepal 2026 followed a three-phase design, that includes:)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
488 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 198 0 R
/T (Phase 1, pre-event. Nine virtual consultations were held across the thematic areas to build baseline knowledge before delegates arrived, alongside a review of national climate policies and the collection of climate concerns, experiences and recommendations from around 180 delegates. Consultations with women-led, disability-led, indigenous and marginalised youth groups were held to identify climate challenges and policy priorities from a GEDSI perspective. Digital outreach and a nationwide call handled delegate selection and the recruitment of youth partners and organising committee members.)
/E (Phase 1, pre-event. Nine virtual consultations were held across the thematic areas to build baseline knowledge before delegates arrived, alongside a review of national climate policies and the collection of climate concerns, experiences and recommendations from around 180 delegates. Consultations with women-led, disability-led, indigenous and marginalised youth groups were held to identify climate challenges and policy priorities from a GEDSI perspective. Digital outreach and a nationwide call handled delegate selection and the recruitment of youth partners and organising committee members.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
489 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 198 0 R
/T (Phase 2, the national event. Three days at Anupam Foodland, combining plenary keynotes, panel discussions, parallel thematic sessions, group workshops, a mock COP simulation, a people's hearing, a climate finance pitching workshop, energizers, cultural night and networking sessions. Notes were taken in every session by a designated two-person note-taking team, rotated daily, which forms the evidence base for this report.)
/E (Phase 2, the national event. Three days at Anupam Foodland, combining plenary keynotes, panel discussions, parallel thematic sessions, group workshops, a mock COP simulation, a people's hearing, a climate finance pitching workshop, energizers, cultural night and networking sessions. Notes were taken in every session by a designated two-person note-taking team, rotated daily, which forms the evidence base for this report.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
490 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 198 0 R
/T (Phase 3, post-event. Formal submission of the National Children and Youth Statement, presentation at national climate consultations, publication of this report, continued digital engagement with delegates, and monitoring against the indicators set out in section 17.)
/E (Phase 3, post-event. Formal submission of the National Children and Youth Statement, presentation at national climate consultations, publication of this report, continued digital engagement with delegates, and monitoring against the indicators set out in section 17.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
