624 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 200 0 R
/T (The first day was built to bring every delegate to a common baseline: what the climate policy architecture is, what the science says about Nepal's mountains and rivers, and where children and youth currently sit in that architecture. Emcees Hemant Kandel and Pramila B.K. opened the proceedings, followed by the national anthem and a minute of silence for lives lost to climate-induced disasters.)
/E (The first day was built to bring every delegate to a common baseline: what the climate policy architecture is, what the science says about Nepal's mountains and rivers, and where children and youth currently sit in that architecture. Emcees Hemant Kandel and Pramila B.K. opened the proceedings, followed by the national anthem and a minute of silence for lives lost to climate-induced disasters.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [11]
>>
