/T (Dr Krishna Prasad Poudel - Forest Action: Dr. Krishna Prasad Poudel connected the climate crisis to human consumption, lifestyles and food systems, arguing that climate action must begin with how we live and what we eat. He challenged delegates to question both their food choices and whether policies discussed at conferences are being implemented on the ground.)
/E (Dr Krishna Prasad Poudel - Forest Action: Dr. Krishna Prasad Poudel connected the climate crisis to human consumption, lifestyles and food systems, arguing that climate action must begin with how we live and what we eat. He challenged delegates to question both their food choices and whether policies discussed at conferences are being implemented on the ground.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [10]
>>
