/T (Maheshwor Dhakal, MoAFE: Maheshwor Dhakal encouraged delegates to use LCOY for networking, collaboration and interpersonal skill development while strengthening youth engagement in climate policy. He highlighted Common But Differentiated Responsibilities, the need to connect climate finance with local action, and stronger youth coordination ahead of COP31.)
/E (Maheshwor Dhakal, MoAFE: Maheshwor Dhakal encouraged delegates to use LCOY for networking, collaboration and interpersonal skill development while strengthening youth engagement in climate policy. He highlighted Common But Differentiated Responsibilities, the need to connect climate finance with local action, and stronger youth coordination ahead of COP31.)
