/E (impacts experienced by women, marginalised communities, and LGBTQIA+ groups. Participants repeatedly identified SRHR as an important but often overlooked dimension within broader discussions on gender equality, disability and social inclusion \(GEDSI\), underscoring the need to better integrate SRHR into climate policies and programmes.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [12]
