/E (Day 2 moved from baseline knowledge to contestation. The morning opened with reflections on Day 1, moderated by Nischal Dhungana and Aaska Aryal, in which delegates including Sarika Chand and Khushi Khanal described what they had learned about who is affected by climate change and how policy groups were divided.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [6]
