<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 220 0 R
/E (The session further explored the unintended consequences of climate solutions, including hydropower impacts and battery waste from electric vehicles. Delegates shared local examples of action, including waste segregation and methane recovery in Dhangadhi, micro-hydro and clean energy initiatives, early warning systems, and a sanitation and resource centre in Syangja. The improved visibility of Everest from Chandragiri during the COVID-19 lockdown was also cited as evidence of human-induced air pollution.)
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
