/Title (It is a privilege to present this report on the Local Conference of Youth \(LCOY\) Nepal 2026. Over three days in Kathmandu, young people from all seven provinces came together not to repeat what they had read about climate change, but to put on record what they had lived through: schools shut for two weeks by heat in Madhesh, a bridge collapsing in Kathmandu, water sources drying in Bardiya, springs disappearing in Kavre, a family in Pokhara losing its home to flash floods and many more.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 5454 0 R
/Next 5568 0 R
>>
endobj
