/Title (The theme we chose this year, "Together for Climate Transparency", was deliberate. Nepal is not short of climate commitments. What has been missing is the ability of ordinary people, and young people in particular, to see what is promised, what is funded, what is delivered and what is still missing. Transparency is what turns a grievance into evidence, and evidence into accountability. That idea ran through every session, from the glacier data presented by ICIMOD to the delegate who asked why there was no child on the panel answering questions about children.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 5454 0 R
/Prev 5553 0 R
/Next 5587 0 R
>>
endobj
