/Title (This report captures what was said, who said it, and what young people asked the state to do about it. It records the sessions, the workshops, the disagreements and the recommendations that became the National Children and Youth Statement on Climate Change 2026. It is not a souvenir. It is a working document, and its usefulness depends entirely on what happens after it is published.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
