5592 0 obj
<<
/Title (The Local Conference of Youth is a national event endorsed by YOUNGO, the official children and youth constituency of the UNFCCC. LCOYs feed into the global Conference of Youth \(COY\) and, through it, into the Conference of the Parties. They exist because only a small number of young people can attend global negotiations in person, and a national platform is needed to build positions that those few delegates can carry.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 5574 0 R
/Next 5612 0 R
>>
endobj
