/Title (LCOY Nepal 2026 was built on a specific bet: that the most useful thing a youth climate conference can do is not raise awareness but raise the standard of evidence young people bring to the table. The theme, "Together for Climate Transparency", was carried into practice through sessions that gave delegates numbers they could cite, methods they could use and cases they could name.)
/Dest [45 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 5575 0 R
/Next 5622 0 R
>>
