/Title (The programme was built around seven thematic pillars: youth and children's engagement in climate processes; loss and damage, climate finance and just transition; changing mountains and livelihoods; climate resilient education systems and Action for Climate Empowerment; agriculture, food security and nutrition; WASH and water security; and children, youth and GEDSI. Across three days, delegates attended plenary sessions, keynotes, dedicated thematic sessions, a mock COP negotiation, a people's hearing on climate justice, a climate finance pitching workshop, a province-wise grassroots case study exercise, and structured group work on Nepal's National Climate Change Policy 2019 and collectively drafted the National Children and Youth Statement on Climate Change.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 5555 0 R
/Prev 5589 0 R
/Next 5635 0 R
>>
endobj
