/Title (The National Children and Youth Statement on Climate Change 2026 now moves to the Government of Nepal, into the review of the National Climate Change Policy 2019, and to YOUNGO for the Global Youth Statement ahead of COP 31 in Antalya. The Minister's invitation to bring findings to the ministry for discussion is an opening, and openings close. As the focal point told delegates in the closing plenary, the success of this conference is determined at ground level, not in the hall.)
