/Title (LCOY Nepal 2026 was held as a three-day residential conference at Anupam Foodland, Battisputali, Kathmandu, on 14, 15 and 16 August 2026. It was open to children and youth aged 10 to 30, with priority given to marginalised, indigenous and ethnic communities, differently-abled individuals, children, women and those directly affected by climate and social adversity. A minimum of 50 percent women and gender-diverse participation was applied to the selection process ensuring that inclusion and equitable representation remained a significant consideration throughout the conference.)
