/Title (The conference was equally clear about its own limits. A delegate asked why there was no child on the panel discussing children, and the organisers accepted the criticism rather than deflecting it. A delegate named the people missing from every inclusion list, including those living on the street. Panelists named the privilege inside the youth climate movement itself: that the same faces travel to COP, that leadership is not transferred, and that media attention concentrates on Kathmandu while activity happens across the country. These were not comfortable observations, and they belong in the record precisely because they are the work that remains.)
