5744 0 obj
<<
/Title (Sanju Lamichhane - Department of Water Supply and Sewerage Management: Sanju Lamichhane highlighted the importance of grounding climate planning in localized analysis to understand specific climate impacts, while noting that limited resources remain a key gap. She emphasized the need for design analysis and emergency response planning across all offices, along with multi-stakeholder communication on WASH, sanitation, and water issues. She also stressed the importance of involving children in these processes from the very beginning.)
/Dest [23 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 5705 0 R
