/Title (Jyanti Bam - UNICEF Youth Advocate: Jyanti Bam, a UNICEF Youth Advocate and Class 10 student, opened the conference by reminding delegates that climate change is no longer a textbook topic but a daily reality, disproportionately affecting children and other vulnerable groups. Speaking for children across Nepal, she questioned whether climate finance and programmes are reaching children on the ground and stressed that climate action must meaningfully include them.)
